The tier admission tests now cover missing and contradictory `args.json` fields, requested-tier mismatches, and state-dict shape mismatches. The exp_05 entry point reuses `run_exp04`; its added model, metadata, and validation hooks keep the existing defaults.

For the timing probe, I’m using a full test-loader pass, so `t_test` will be measured without extrapolation.
