The requested coverage exceeds 200 changed lines in some of the named cycles. I’ll preserve the line limit by splitting those into smaller TDD commits, since the optional preference question has no reply yet.

For re-probing after a failed training attempt, I’ll keep the cumulative budget conservative: a new receipt can lower an arm’s ceiling, but cannot raise it after the arm has spent training time. I’ll call out that edge-case policy in the handoff.
